From bd87ef453918c861167318a870dace304a06c95b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johnathon Selstad <makeshifted@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 13:01:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] GLTFLoader: Add MSFT_lod support.

A node with `MSFT_lod` is returned inside a `LOD`. Level 0 is the node
itself, the other levels are the nodes the extension lists (or, for
material LODs, clones of the node with the listed materials). The
distances are derived from `MSFT_screencoverage`. Files that do not use
the extension are loaded as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 examples/jsm/loaders/GLTFLoader.js           | 390 ++++++++++++++++++-
 test/unit/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.tests.js | 102 +++++
 2 files changed, 491 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

